    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/42e49649550ac0186ddd2dae9150cff3.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/42e49649550ac0186ddd2dae9150cff3.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/42e49649550ac0186ddd2dae9150cff3.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/0a8a8c277111a3d5e15645e9f6db7cef.avif?t=1754249870\" width=359 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give it your best in the workshop, because here at the <strong>GunShop</strong>, we value every single worker, so get your hands dirty because the spot is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/6903894ef2f6f6daee4eaac2a44944de.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/6903894ef2f6f6daee4eaac2a44944de.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/6903894ef2f6f6daee4eaac2a44944de.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/c55595fc6e43a8122cedea1b546d8fb1.avif?t=1754249870\" width=359 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find yourself in any danger, the <strong>GunShop</strong> is not responsible for any damage physical or psychological on workers, so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/716ccd4c889f5bb7856cfdf7d2a8005a.avif?t=1754249870\" width=359 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always finish your work on time, every shift has a deadline to deliver your work, the workers that choose not to deliver in time, <span class=\"bb_strike\">are all sent to him</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/94c2c2b8a13279f42449c1e307114538.avif?t=1754249870\" width=363 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is important to maintain communication with your coworkers, during meals every worker gathers at the cafeteria of the Gunshop to eat and socialize.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/42e49649550ac0186ddd2dae9150cff3.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/42e49649550ac0186ddd2dae9150cff3.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/42e49649550ac0186ddd2dae9150cff3.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/0a8a8c277111a3d5e15645e9f6db7cef.avif?t=1754249870\" width=359 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give it your best in the workshop, because here at the <strong>GunShop</strong>, we value every single worker, so get your hands dirty because the spot is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/6903894ef2f6f6daee4eaac2a44944de.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/6903894ef2f6f6daee4eaac2a44944de.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/6903894ef2f6f6daee4eaac2a44944de.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/c55595fc6e43a8122cedea1b546d8fb1.avif?t=1754249870\" width=359 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find yourself in any danger, the <strong>GunShop</strong> is not responsible for any damage physical or psychological on workers, so be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/a9ba553482d6e812db12840dbb76f433.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/716ccd4c889f5bb7856cfdf7d2a8005a.avif?t=1754249870\" width=359 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always finish your work on time, every shift has a deadline to deliver your work, the workers that choose not to deliver in time, <span class=\"bb_strike\">are all sent to him</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.poster.avif?t=1754249870\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.webm?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/4c9b09f617a7e961f941e2a6280416e6.mp4?t=1754249870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/94c2c2b8a13279f42449c1e307114538.avif?t=1754249870\" width=363 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is important to maintain communication with your coworkers, during meals every worker gathers at the cafeteria of the Gunshop to eat and socialize.</p>",
